      "fileName": "alchemical-familiar.json",
      "id": "loC0wIyIrsG43Zrd",
      "name": "Alchemical Familiar",
      "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
      "type": "feat",
      "data": {
        "_id": "loC0wIyIrsG43Zrd",
        "folder": "PiL5s3HX82D61u1D",
        "img": "icons/sundries/books/book-red-exclamation.webp",
        "name": "Alchemical Familiar",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "passive"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You have used alchemy to create life, a simple creature formed from alchemical materials, reagents, and a bit of your own blood. You gain a familiar, which has the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.familiar-abilities.Item.Construct] familiar ability; this is permanent, doesn't require the familiar to have the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.familiar-abilities.Item.Tough] familiar ability, and doesn't count against your usual limit of familiar abilities (typically 2). The familiar uses your Intelligence modifier to determine its Perception, Acrobatics, and Stealth modifiers.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
            "value": []
          },
          "publication": {
            "license": "ORC",
            "remaster": true,
            "title": "Pathfinder Player Core 2"
          },
