        "name": "Quick Bomber",
        "system": {
          "actionType": {
            "value": "action"
          },
          "actions": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "category": "class",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>You keep your bombs and bomb-related reagents in easy-toreach pouches from which you draw without thinking. You Interact to draw a bomb, draw a versatile vial, or use @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Quick Alchemy] to create a bomb, then @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Strike] with the bomb. If you have the ability to create more than one bomb at a time with Quick Alchemy (such as from the double brew class feature), you can Strike with only one of the bombs you create with this action.</p>"
          },
